Here is the commit message:
fix bug introduced by 8d34e2547

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the failure to properly mark modules as invalid when no final destination was found or when the current path was invalid. This oversight allowed invalid modules to be processed further, leading to incorrect behavior in the linked module checks.

